oser to Ground War in Kosovo Than is Widely Realized,” New York Times,  \nNovember 7, 1999, p. A-6.  \n208 Steven Erlanger. “NATO was Closer to Ground War in Kosovo Than is Widely Realized,” New York Times,  \nNovember 7, 1999, p. A-6.  \n209 Washington Post, September 19, 1999, p. A-30.  \n210 Washington Post, September 19, 1999, p. A-30.  \n211 Washington Post, June 26, 1999, p. A-1.  \n\nOther search engine output:\n{\"related_searches\": [\"State department kosovo 1998 unemployment 70% fled helicopter update\", \"State department kosovo 1998 unemployment 70% fled helicopter pdf\", \"State department kosovo 1998 unemployment 70% fled helicopter map\", \"State department kosovo 1998 unemployment 70% fled helicopter 2022\", \"U.S. troops in Kosovo 1999\", \"U.S. involvement in Kosovo War\", \"Who won the Kosovo War\", \"Kosovo-Serbia conflict today\"]}"
